cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this index or its scores, please cite it."
title: "The Register Integrity Index (RII) v1"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Rovai
    given-names: Fabio
    affiliation: "Kampakis and Co Ltd (The Tesseract Academy)"
    email: fabio@thetesseractacademy.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/fabio-rovai/register-integrity-index"
abstract: >-
  A league table scoring twenty-one public registers on identifier and record governance
  across five dimensions, computed entirely from findings already recorded in nine shipped
  open-ontology repositories, with a provenance trail from every scored cell back to the
  artifact that recorded the underlying count.
keywords:
  - register integrity
  - identifier governance
  - data quality
  - benchmark
  - public registers
  - register assurance
  - ontology
